# z undoes a } that moved an Upcoming entry to a later day, and Z redoes it, the focus staying on the entry.
file <<END
- Moved @due({today+1})
- Fixed @due({today+2})
END
keys gU
see ▌ - Moved
keys }} z Z z
saved <<END
- Moved @due({today+2})
- Fixed @due({today+2})
END
keys j
see ▌ - Fixed
quit
saved <<END
- Moved @due({today+2})
- Fixed @due({today+2})
END
